`TASK_DIR` = the package's task/spec/budget json plus the key's `truth.json`. `ORIG_CLIP_CFR` = the Reference clip re-timed to constant 24 fps
(`ffmpeg -vf fps=24`), because the clip is variable-frame-rate (765 frames) and the cut detector converts frame index to time.
